      "command": ".venv/bin/python scripts/train.py --help",
      "returncode": 0,
      "help": "usage: train.py [-h] [--task {text,sft,dpo,distill,vision,audio,joint}]\n                [--train] [--data DATA] [--checkpoint CHECKPOINT] [--resume]\n                [--teacher TEACHER] [--freeze {none,projector,partial}]\n                [--vision-encoder VISION_ENCODER]\n                [--audio-encoder AUDIO_ENCODER] [--steps STEPS]\n                [--stop-after STOP_AFTER] [--save-every SAVE_EVERY]\n                [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE] [--width WIDTH] [--layers LAYERS]\n                [--heads HEADS] [--max-length MAX_LENGTH] [--experts EXPERTS]\n                [--top-k TOP_K] [--rotary] [--norm {layer,rms}]\n                [--activation {gelu,relu2,swiglu}] [--backend {manual,sdpa}]\n                [--tied] [--kv-heads KV_HEADS] [--device DEVICE] [--lr LR]\n                [--seed SEED] [--beta BETA] [--alpha ALPHA]\n                [--temperature TEMPERATURE] [--output OUTPUT]\n\nGPU 訓練入口；不加 --train 時只做 forward/backward，不更新權重。\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --task {text,sft,dpo,distill,vision,audio,joint}\n  --train               明確開啟權重更新；預設只檢查梯度\n  --data DATA           text/messages 或 chosen/rejected JSONL；預設使用課程合成規則\n  --checkpoint CHECKPOINT\n                        載入文字或完整多模態模型；--resume 同時恢復 optimizer/RNG\n  --resume\n  --teacher TEACHER\n  --freeze {none,projector,partial}\n  --vision-encoder VISION_ENCODER\n  --audio-encoder AUDIO_ENCODER\n  --steps STEPS\n  --stop-after STOP_AFTER\n                        提前在這個絕對步數停止；不改變 --steps 的 LR 排程\n  --save-every SAVE_EVERY\n                        完整 checkpoint 的週期存檔間隔\n  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE\n  --width WIDTH\n  --layers LAYERS\n  --heads HEADS\n  --max-length MAX_LENGTH\n  --experts EXPERTS\n  --top-k TOP_K\n  --rotary\n  --norm {layer,rms}\n  --activation {gelu,relu2,swiglu}\n  --backend {manual,sdpa}\n  --tied\n  --kv-heads KV_HEADS\n  --device DEVICE\n  --lr LR\n  --seed SEED\n  --beta BETA\n  --alpha ALPHA\n  --temperature TEMPERATURE\n  --output OUTPUT\n"
    },
    "scripts/evaluate.py": {
      "command": ".venv/bin/python scripts/evaluate.py --help",
      "returncode": 0,
      "help": "usage: evaluate.py [-h] [--data DATA] [--mode {text,sft}]\n                   [--split-label {train-diagnostic,validation,test}]\n                   [--limit LIMIT] [--tokens TOKENS] [--tokenizer TOKENIZER]\n                   [--device DEVICE] [--output OUTPUT]\n                   checkpoint\n\n離線評估文字 checkpoint；分開核對內容、正常結束與實際評估分母。\n\npositional arguments:\n  checkpoint\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --data DATA\n  --mode {text,sft}\n  --split-label {train-diagnostic,validation,test}\n  --limit LIMIT         最多選取的資料筆數；all 選取整份資料（預設 20）\n  --tokens TOKENS\n  --tokenizer TOKENIZER\n                        訓練時的 BPE／byte JSON；核對詞表、特殊 ID 與 checkpoint SHA 綁定\n  --device DEVICE\n  --output OUTPUT\n"
